l to the center of L5-S1, then 30-45° cephalad and medial into the interspace."}],"summary":"Paramedian 3-step: L4-L5 or L5-S1 → entry 2 cm lateral + 2 cm caudal → 30-45° cephalomedial, no ligament LOR","skippable":true}'::jsonb
